P2b. Which axis moves the algebra
=================================

Exhaustive over every triple in the domain, per configuration.
W is total stored bits, F is fraction bits.

--- overflow = wrap      rounding = truncate  W = 6 ---
  F = 0
      (a+b)+c == a+(b+c)     HOLDS  (0/262144)
      (a*b)*c == a*(b*c)     HOLDS  (0/262144)
      a*(b+c) == a*b+a*c     HOLDS  (0/262144)
  F = 1
      (a+b)+c == a+(b+c)     HOLDS  (0/262144)
      (a*b)*c == a*(b*c)     FAILS  137472/262144 =  52.4%   first: a=1,b=1,c=4 -> 0 vs 1
      a*(b+c) == a*b+a*c     FAILS  80384/262144 =  30.7%   first: a=1,b=1,c=1 -> 1 vs 0
